    LLM: 'Game: Zole. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zole (Zolīte) is Latvia's national card game. 3 players (4-5 with dealer out). 26-card deck. 8 each + 2-card talon. Permanent trumps: Queens > Jacks > Diamonds. Declarer: take talon, discard 2, win 61+ of 120 card points. Solo = no talon. Mazais = lose every trick. Table game = fewest points.",
    objective: 'Declarer: 61+ of 120 card points. Solo: same without talon. Mazais: lose every trick.',
